[tjc@ecs.soton.ac.uk (Tim Chown) asks:]
[] Has anyone completed nethack without cheating (copying the save file,
[] or any other trick) ??

my dungeon has the backup feature incorporated automatically in the
play of the game. i have access to the backups, no one else does. a
script can access the backups, as needed (i.e. system crashes, etc.).
there's an informal honor code to the effect that i look for cheating
and will punish it when detected. others can try to cheat if they're
so inclined however after they're successful they should admit it. only
one hacker has tried cheating and was caught by the system and destroyed!

i've won without cheating but i'm sure you want better evidence.
others in my dungeon have won without cheating, also. of course, these
winning games often span several weeks!

i'm sure we're not alone ...

